<section>
    <h2>Workshop Details</h2>
    <p>Join us for our hands-on workshop, "Mastering Plant Care," where you will learn essential skills to keep your plants healthy and thriving!</p>
    <p><strong>Date:</strong> Saturday, March 15, 2024</p>
    <p><strong>Time:</strong> 10:00 AM - 2:00 PM</p>
    <p><strong>Location:</strong> Community Garden Center, 123 Greenway Drive</p>
    <p><strong>Price:</strong> $50 per person</p>

    <h3>Instructions for Enrollment</h3>
    <ol>
        <li>Fill out the enrollment form below with your details.</li>
        <li>Submit the form to confirm your spot in the workshop.</li>
        <li>You will receive a confirmation email with further details.</li>
        <li>Payment can be made via credit card or PayPal after submission.</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>Enrollment Form</h3>
    <form id="enrollmentForm">
        <label for="name">Full Name:</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>

        <label for="email">Email Address:</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>

        <label for="phone">Phone Number:</label>
        <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required>

        <label for="comments">Any Comments or Questions:</label>
        <textarea id="comments" name="comments"></textarea>

        <button type="submit" class="button">Submit Enrollment</button>
    </form>

    <h3>Restrictions</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Participants must be at least 16 years old to enroll.</li>
        <li>Due to limited space, only 20 participants will be accepted on a first-come, first-served basis.</li>
        <li>Cancellation requests must be made at least 48 hours before the workshop for a full refund.</li>
        <li>Please inform us of any allergies or special needs in advance.</li>
    </ul>
